DESCRIPTION:Nick Mullen is an American stand-up comedian\, podcaster\, prod
 ucer\, actor and comedy writer. He is best known for creating and hosting t
 he comedy podcast  Cum Town  ([contact removed]). Consistently one of the
  most popular podcasts on Patreon\, it also concluded as one of the top 25 
 comedy podcasts on Spotify and Apple Podcasts. Following the end of  Cum T
 own \, Mullen created its successor  The Adam Friedland Show  (2022-Prese
 nt). Guests of the show include Neil deGrasse Tyson\, Shane Gillis\, Chris 
 Cuomo\, Norman Finklestein\, Paul Schrader\, and Chet Hanks. Mullen release
 d his first comedy special  The Year of The Dragon  in December of 2023. 
 It reached over one million views within its first week.\n\nPlease note\, t
